": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the display uses a front-access service design that allows easy maintenance and repairs without removing the entire unit from the wall, ensuring minimal disruption.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the display, and does it suit brightly lit gallery environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 800 nits, the display delivers vivid visuals visible even in well-lit exhibition spaces, making it ideal for galleries and auction houses with ambient lighting.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty options are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard manufacturer warranty which covers parts and labor for a defined period. Extended warranty options are available upon request to ensure long-term peace of mind.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the ArtFrame Gallery 1.2 compare to traditional framed digital displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional framed displays, the ArtFrame Gallery 1.2 offers a seamless bezel-free viewing experience with zero visible gaps, delivering a more immersive and continuous digital canvas ideal for high-end galleries.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this product suitable for multi-panel installations?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it features integrated color calibration technology that ensures consistent color reproduction across multiple panels, creating a uniform and immersive visual experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the weight and depth of the ArtFrame Gallery 1.2?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display weighs 18kg per square meter and has a slim depth of 38mm, allowing for sleek, flush wall mounting without bulkiness.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which ty